{{Term/Store|Dodging||Series, AoI}},{{Exp Game|HW, AoI}}<ref name="HW Button Settings"/><ref name="AoI Tips and Tricks"/> also known as {{Term/Store|Evading||HW, HWL, HWDE}},{{Exp Game|HW}}<ref name="HW Tutorials"/> is a recurring ability in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Overview==
==={{HW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Stub|HWDE}}
A [[Warrior]] can Evade an attack from an [[Enemy]] by pressing the B Button in [[Warriors Style]] controls or pressing the A Button in [[Zelda Style]] controls.<ref name="HW Tutorials 2"/>
{{Noncanon|End}}

==={{AoI|-}}===
Dodging can be performed by [[Warrior]]s with the [[B Button]]. Dodging can be used to avoid attacks and to cancel attack animations. By Dodging within a small window of time for an [[Enemy]]'s attack, Warriors can execute [[Perfect Dodging|Perfect Dodge]]s.{{Verify}}

